    "@id": "http://ecoinformatics.org/oboe/oboe.1.0/oboe-core.owl#Measurement",
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@value": "\n  an oboe-core:Measurement is a (atomic) sosa:Observation, whose result (value) is an estimate of the value of one of the characteristics of the observed Entity. \n  A collection of oboe-core:Measurement individuals together compose an oboe-core:Observation, whose results together provide a full description of the feature of interest. \n  "
      }
    ],
